  "components": [
    {
      "id": "survivor-wave",
      "explanation": "The cycle, the person survivor's wave: the cutout rig rebuilt from the session's old drawing as Polygon2D parts, the Shoulder pivot and its wave clip keyed as resource text; session.gd, which places the rig once, hides it on rescue and shows it on restart; and the wave viewing fixture.",
      "beat_ids": [
        "B04",
        "B05",
        "B02"
      ],
      "files": [
        "features/survivor/survivor_person.tscn",
        "game/session.gd",
        "previews/wave_preview.gd",
        "previews/wave_preview.tscn"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "toss-sheet",
      "explanation": "The committing action, Joe's survivor toss: the sheet packed from the A2 poses (with its import settings and credits), Joe's art scene with the sliced Sprite and the manual-callback AnimationPlayer, the clip library baked from the phase table, the player's state machine that plays one clip per state and advances it on the physics tick, and the frame-strip fixture.",
      "beat_ids": [
        "B06",
        "B07",
        "B08",
        "B09",
        "B12",
        "B13",
        "B14",
        "B15"
      ],
      "files": [
        "animations/joe.tres",
        "art/character/ATTRIBUTION.md",
        "art/character/joe_sheet.png",
        "art/character/joe_sheet.png.import",
        "features/player/joe_art.tscn",
        "features/player/player.gd",
        "previews/toss_preview.gd",
        "previews/toss_preview.tscn",
        "tools/bake_joe_clips.gd"
      ]
    },
