      "text": "[node name=\"Sprite\" type=\"Sprite2D\" parent=\".\"]\ntexture = ExtResource(\"1_sheet\")\ncentered = false\nposition = Vector2(-70, -133)\nhframes = 4\nvframes = 3\n\n[node name=\"AnimationPlayer\" type=\"AnimationPlayer\" parent=\".\"]\nlibraries = {\n&\"\": ExtResource(\"2_clips\")\n}\ncallback_mode_process = 2"
